      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُطْءٌ</span></b>  inf. n. of 1. (S, Msb, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  One says, in
the dial. of Benoo-Yarbooa, (TA,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمْ أَفْعَلْهُ بُطْءًا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَاهٰذَا</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُطْأَى</span></b> , [<i>I never did it,</i> lit.] <i>I did it
not ever, O thou!</i> i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الدَّهْرَ</span>. (K, TA.)

